experiment.prespecified:
Fixed 2026-11-19, before any zoo result was read (borg-reborn-rs#644, PR #656). Pilot (RULES 16).
Gate:
- no config_error; one binary; each arm's value in borg.txt and in params-core.json of the death replays;
- every cell ends in death, turn_cap or borg_stopped; frozen-turn bursts classified and key outliers listed;
- death bundles reproduced;
- in off, no "breeders known on the level" note.
Report per arm and per class:
- deaths and causes, final level, deepest level; paired rescued and newly killed against off;
- "# No rest: N breeders known on the level, hunting them|leaving" notes, "# Leaving (breeders on the level, no
  rest)" and "# Not leaving: the breeder hunt applies again" per game;
- deaths with a breeder adjacent or within 2,000 game turns of a held rest; levels left by the rule and what follows.
Context: a local run on the same tree (18 classes-18 starts, 100,000 turns; not a zoo run): 0 deaths in both arms,
sum of CL 97 / 100; 561 held rests in 13 games (126 hunting, 25 leaves, 1 hunt resumed). Direction only.
